{"id":"73eb4bf154d08499","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-tarski-definability.md","title":"Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","display":"thm-tarski-definability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-tarski-definability","aliases":["57-thm-tarski-definability"],"display":"thm-tarski-definability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-truth-predicate]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-tarski-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-tarski-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tarski-definability — Tarski's Undefinability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Tarski's-Undefinability-Theorem\">Tarski's Undefinability Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a> 的标准算术结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 为固定变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2d8f5002c4256603\" href=\"?note=2d8f5002c4256603\" title=\"57-df-truth-predicate\">57-df-truth-predicate</a>；代入数码取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"afc42c965ba86683\" href=\"?note=afc42c965ba86683\" title=\"57-df-numeral\">57-df-numeral</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\mathbb N)\">\\(S(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 加入互异新常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n\">\\(c_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N^+\">\\(\\mathfrak N^+\\)</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n\">\\(c_n\\)</span> 解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 由下式在本文件定义；扩张语言保留原符号分区，仅添加零元函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_n\">\\(c_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}(n)\\)</span> 是下式定义的数值真理谓词，自变量为相对固定编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的自然数编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S(\\mathbb N)}:\\mathfrak N^+\\models\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S(\\mathbb N)}:\\mathfrak N^+\\models\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}(n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak N,g}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}(n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak N,g}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)\\models\\left(\\tau[\\underline{g(\\sigma)}/x]\\leftrightarrow\\sigma\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S}\\;\\left[\\mathrm{FV}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\quad\n\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)\\models\\left(\\tau[\\underline{g(\\sigma)}/x]\\leftrightarrow\\sigma\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留初等图版本。对公式 τ 的存在量词在元层；初等图只蕴涵逐句的对象语言双条件，不把“存在公式”伪装成一阶公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Tarski's-Undefinability-Theorem","text":"Tarski's Undefinability Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","l